sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend (Vue 3)
    participant RC as ResourceController
    participant SS as ShareTransferService
    participant R as Redis
    participant C as Client (115driver)
    participant API as 115 WebAPI
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    Note over U,PG: === Phase 1: 分享链接解析 (同步) ===

    U->>FE: 粘贴分享链接 + 点击解析
    FE->>FE: 正则提取 shareCode, password
    FE->>RC: POST /api/v1/resource/115-share/parse
    RC->>SS: ParseShareLink(url, password)

    SS->>SS: 校验 URL 格式（正则 /s/(\w+)）
    alt URL 不合法
        SS-->>RC: INVALID_URL
        RC-->>FE: {code: INVALID_URL}
        FE->>FE: ShareLinkInput → error 状态
    end

    SS->>C: 调用 115 webapi 分享接口
    Note over C,API: POST webapi.115.com/share/snap

    alt 分享失效
        API-->>C: errNo=990001
        SS-->>RC: SHARE_EXPIRED
        RC-->>FE: {code: SHARE_EXPIRED}
        FE->>FE: ShareLinkInput → error 状态
    else 需要密码
        API-->>C: errNo=990002
        SS-->>RC: PASSWORD_REQUIRED
        RC-->>FE: {code: PASSWORD_REQUIRED}
        FE->>FE: ShareLinkInput → 展开密码输入框
    else 成功
        API-->>C: {data: {list: [...], count: 195}}
        C-->>SS: 文件列表
        SS->>SS: 转换为 ShareFileInfo[]
        SS->>R: 缓存解析结果 (TTL 5min)
        SS-->>RC: ParseShareResponse
        RC-->>FE: {code: 0, data: {shareCode, folderName, files, totalFiles, totalSize}}
        FE->>FE: ShareLinkInput → parsed<br/>FileSelector + TargetFolderPicker 渲染
    end

    Note over U,PG: === Phase 2: 转存提交 + 异步执行 ===

    U->>FE: 选择文件 + 目标目录 + 点击转存
    FE->>RC: POST /api/v1/resource/115-share/transfer
    RC->>SS: SubmitTransfer(req)

    SS->>SS: 校验必填字段
    SS->>C: GetCIDByPath(targetDirectory)
    alt 目录不存在
        SS->>C: MkdirAll115(targetDirectory)
    end

    SS->>R: CreateTask("share-transfer-{uuid}", share_transfer, taskName)
    SS->>R: UpdateMetadata(taskId, metadata)
    SS->>PG: BatchInsert(transferLogs) → pending

    SS-->>RC: {taskId, totalFiles, estimatedSize}
    RC-->>FE: {code: 0, data: {taskId, ...}}
    FE->>FE: TransferProgress → queued 状态

    Note over SS: --- 异步 goroutine 开始 ---
    SS->>SS: executeTransfer(taskId, req)
    SS->>R: UpdateTaskStatus(taskId, "running")

    loop 遍历 files[]
        SS->>R: IsTaskCancelled(taskId)
        alt 已取消
            SS->>R: UpdateTaskStatus(taskId, "cancelled")
        end

        SS->>C: GetFileInfo(pickCode) → SHA1
        SS->>C: RapidTransferFile(pickCode, sourceID, sourceCookie, targetCID, targetID, targetCookie)

        alt 秒传成功
            SS->>PG: UPDATE log SET status='success'
            SS->>R: AddProcessedFileID + UpdateProgress
        else 秒传失败 → 自动重试 1 次
            alt 重试成功
                SS->>PG: UPDATE log SET status='success'
            else 重试失败
                SS->>PG: UPDATE log SET status='failed'
            end
        end
    end

    alt 全部成功
        SS->>R: UpdateTaskStatus(taskId, "completed")
    else 部分失败
        SS->>R: UpdateTaskStatus(taskId, "partial_failed")
    else 全部失败
        SS->>R: UpdateTaskStatus(taskId, "failed")
    end

    Note over U,PG: === Phase 3: 前端轮询进度 ===

    loop 每 2 秒（直到终态）
        FE->>RC: GET /api/v1/resource/115-share/transfer/{taskId}
        RC->>SS: GetProgress(taskId)
        SS->>R: GetTask(taskId) → TaskStatus
        SS-->>RC: TransferProgressResponse
        RC-->>FE: {status, progress, totalFiles, processedFiles, ...}
        FE->>FE: TransferProgress 更新状态
    end

    Note over U,PG: === Phase 4: 取消/重试（可选） ===

    opt 用户取消
        U->>FE: 点击取消转存
        FE->>RC: POST /api/v1/resource/115-share/transfer/{taskId}/cancel
        RC->>SS: CancelTransfer(taskId)
        SS->>R: SetTaskCancelFlag(taskId)
        SS->>R: UpdateTaskStatus(taskId, "cancelled")
        SS-->>RC: {taskId, status: "cancelled", completedFiles, cancelledFiles}
        RC-->>FE: 显示取消结果
    end

    opt 用户重试失败项
        U->>FE: 点击重试全部失败项
        FE->>RC: POST /api/v1/resource/115-share/transfer/{taskId}/retry
        RC->>SS: RetryTransfer(taskId)
        SS->>R: GetTask(taskId) → failedItems
        SS->>R: ClearCancelFlag + Reset status → "pending"
        SS-->>RC: {taskId, retriedFiles, message}
        RC-->>FE: 重新进入轮询
    end
